# Thunderbolts Conspiracy: "Whenever a Villain you control dies, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a
# finality counter on it" (CR 700.4, 603.10a, 110.2). Bot1 takes Bot2's Agents of HYDRA with Claim the Firstborn and sacrifices it
# to Village Rites: it died a Villain Bot1 controlled, so it returns - under Bot2's control, its owner's, a Hero with a finality
# counter. Bot1's own Savannah Lions, no Villain, stays in the graveyard when Bolted, and so does Bot2's Kingpin's Enforcers, a
# Villain Bot1 never controlled.

