Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Thunderbolts Conspiracy
Savannah Lions
Claim the Firstborn
Village Rites
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Agents of HYDRA
Kingpin's Enforcers
Island x20

